Notes on third-party packages:

This project depends on several third-party packages (flutter_webrtc,
cryptography, noise_meter, network_info_plus, permission_handler, image,
provider), each under its own open-source license (mostly BSD/MIT/Apache-2.0
style, all commercial-use-friendly). Running `flutter pub get` will fetch
their license files under `.dart_tool/`/`pub-cache` — review those if you
redistribute the compiled app, as most permissive licenses require keeping
their copyright notices in distributed binaries/attribution screens.

Replace "Your Company/Name" above with your actual company or personal name
before shipping commercially.
